  "schema:name": "Care Transition Coordination",
  "schema:description": "Care Transition Coordination:&#xD;\nStandardized discharge, referral, and transfer protocols.&#xD;\nCreation and exchange of structured transition documentation (e.g., discharge summary, referral note).&#xD;\nTask assignment for follow-up actions (appointments, medication reconciliation).&#xD;\nCommunication channel for clarifications between sending and receiving providers.&#xD;\nPatient and caregiver empowerment (education, follow-up reminders, self-monitoring tools).",
  "schema:category": "Strategy",
